WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.741
Android 17

00:00:01.895 --> 00:00:02.920
running inside an

00:00:02.732 --> 00:00:03.651
iPhone app

00:00:04.182 --> 00:00:05.278
Nestvane is a

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:06.682
new open-source project

00:00:06.493 --> 00:00:07.224
that runs a

00:00:07.036 --> 00:00:08.757
full Android 17

00:00:08.569 --> 00:00:10.019
system inside an

00:00:09.842 --> 00:00:11.233
ordinary iOS app

00:00:11.375 --> 00:00:12.401
with no JIT

00:00:12.342 --> 00:00:13.498
and no jailbreak

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:15.723
iOS bans executable

00:00:15.535 --> 00:00:16.148
memory

00:00:16.172 --> 00:00:17.363
so Android is

00:00:17.174 --> 00:00:18.353
translated ahead of

00:00:18.165 --> 00:00:18.742
time

00:00:18.814 --> 00:00:19.650
and paired with

00:00:19.462 --> 00:00:20.488
a Linux kernel

00:00:20.299 --> 00:00:21.183
layer written for

00:00:20.995 --> 00:00:21.620
the app.

00:00:22.142 --> 00:00:23.014
On an iPhone

00:00:22.826 --> 00:00:24.123
17 Pro it

00:00:23.934 --> 00:00:24.795
reaches the home

00:00:24.607 --> 00:00:25.455
screen in about

00:00:25.267 --> 00:00:26.505
ten seconds and

00:00:26.317 --> 00:00:28.038
plays 720p video

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:28.910
at 30 frames

00:00:28.722 --> 00:00:29.547
per second

00:00:29.686 --> 00:00:30.794
It's developer-only

00:00:30.606 --> 00:00:31.266
for now

00:00:31.806 --> 00:00:32.820
Full story on

00:00:32.631 --> 00:00:33.527
the dashboard
